      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "外　高二十石八斗七升五合三勺三才　込高"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "In addition (外): 20.87533 koku — komidaka, i.e. yield surveyed in over and above the registered assessment. This supplements the 社寺領高 (shrine-and-temple land, 653.26 koku) that closes the facing page 94. The small 外 sits in its own marginal column to the right of the value; the qualifier 込高 prints below the last digit in the same column."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "外高（込高）"
      }
    ],
