      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Of which: 35 koku is precinct-exempt land (境内除地), from which no revenue accrues (歳入無之). The parent of this 内 is the shrine-and-temple land account as a whole — the 社寺領高 of 653.26 koku carried over from the facing page 94, plus the 20.87533 koku komidaka in the column to the right (674.13533 koku combined) — not the 20.87533 komidaka on its own, which is smaller than 35 koku. The 内 marker is a small right-shifted glyph (x2528-2569) heading the column."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "内高（境内除地）"
